    {
      "name": "Dancer",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/magic/life/heart-pink.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>She moves abstract just like a shadow dancing on the edge, like a storm cloud passing overhead, hypnotizing me.</strong></p><p><em>—Dillinger Escape Plan, One of Us is the Killer</em></p><p>Dancers are practitioners of the alluring art of dance. They have a flair for enlivening their audience and giving awe-inspiring shows.</p><h3>Iconic Dancers</h3><ul><li><strong>Apsalar</strong>, <em>Malazan Book of the Fallen</em></li><li><strong>Azura</strong>, <em>Fire Emblem Fates</em></li><li><strong>Sandrilene fa Toren</strong>, <em>The Circle Opens</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Dancer</h3><p>The dancer is a low-defense support with a focus on action efficiency. Grant Actions through Step Up, as your main offenses will occur when you Crit on Reflex Saves.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Attack<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Midline (Step Up)<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Courtesan or Musician<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Dexterity<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★☆☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Finesse, Performance</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Step Up, Footloose</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Evasive (10’)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Captivator (Cd4)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Evasive (15’), Don’t Stop Me Now</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Captivator (Cd6)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Evasive (20’), Double Time</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": false,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Step Up",
            "description": "<p>Once per Round when you Move, you can make a Finesse Check. On a pass, one Being of your choice other than yourself that sees you can immediately take an extra Action.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": [],
